# Dependencies — reinstalled via `npm install`, never tracked.
/node_modules

# The build OUTPUT (backend/wwwroot/widget/nivora-widget.js) is deliberately
# NOT ignored/excluded from git, unlike frontend's /.next/. That output is
# the actual asset ASP.NET Core serves to real embedded widgets, and this
# project has no CI/CD pipeline yet to regenerate it on deploy — committing
# the built bundle is what makes a plain `git clone` + `dotnet run` actually
# serve a working widget, rather than 404ing until someone remembers to run
# `npm run build` here first. Revisit this once a real build/deploy
# pipeline exists for the project.
